          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">GlucoTru is an all-natural formula that contains only ingredients that are safe to consume and have no side effects. Here is a quick rundown of some of the many ingredients found in this formula:-\n<div>\n</div><div><br></div></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Prosta Peak™ is a dietary supplement formulated with a blend of botanical ingredients designed to support prostate health, urinary function, and men's overall wellness. Its current product website highlights six key natural ingredients. These plant-based ingredients are traditionally used in men's wellness supplements and provide various nutritional compounds.<br><br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tB1AZH7rno",
          "_anchor": "content5-n",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (min-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "4rem"
              },
              "&:last-child": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardText)": {
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardTitle)": {
                "& when (@showCardText)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showArrows)": {
                "align-items": "flex-start"
              },
              "&.last": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".icon-box": {
              "background": "@iconColor",
              "width": "60px",
              "min-width": "60px",
              "height": "60px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "margin-right": "2rem",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center",
              "position": "relative",
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "margin-right": "1rem"
              },
              "& when (@showArrows)": {
                "&::before": {
                  "content": "\"\\e925\"",
                  "font-family": "Moririse2 !important",
                  "position": "absolute",
                  "font-size": "~\"@{arrowsSize}px\"",
                  "left": "50%",
                  "top": "~\"@{arrowsTop}%\"",
                  "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                    "top": "100%"
                  },
                  "color": "@iconColor",
                  "transform": "translate(-50%, 0)"
                }
              }
            },
            "span": {
              "font-size": "2rem",
              "color": "contrast(@iconColor, darken(@iconColor, 50%), #ffffff, 60%)"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".card": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".card-wrapper": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "141%",
                    "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                      "top": "123%"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "114%"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "features20",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features19\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"7\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Steps\" name=\"steps\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\" selected>6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\">\n        <header>Step</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Arrows\" name=\"showArrows\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#22a5e5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Size\" name=\"arrowsSize\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"32\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Top\" name=\"arrowsTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"150\" step=\"1\" value=\"120\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButton\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper pb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\">\n                            <b>Steps</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Mobirise is a free offline app for Windows and Mac to easily create small/medium websites,\n                            landing pages, online resumes and portfolios. 2500+ beautiful website blocks, templates and\n                            themes help you to start easily.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButton\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Create\n                                your own site</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth-1}}\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 1}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">1</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Saw Palmetto</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Saw Palmetto is one of the most commonly used botanical ingredients in prostate health supplements. It comes from the berries of the Serenoa repens palm tree. It contains naturally occurring fatty acids and plant compounds and is traditionally used to support normal prostate function and urinary wellness. However, clinical research has not consistently demonstrated benefits for urinary symptoms.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 2}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">2</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Pygeum</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Pygeum is an herbal extract obtained from the bark of the African cherry tree. It has a long history of traditional use in men's health formulations. It contains plant compounds that are being studied for their potential role in supporting normal urinary function and prostate wellness.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 3}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">3</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Green Tea</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Green tea is derived from the leaves of the Camellia sinensis plant. It contains natural antioxidants called catechins, including EGCG. These compounds help protect cells from oxidative stress and contribute to general wellness. Green tea is also valued for its potential contribution to healthy metabolic and cellular functions.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 4}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">4</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Cat's Claw</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Cat's Claw is a traditional botanical obtained from a tropical climbing vine. It contains naturally occurring plant compounds, including alkaloids and polyphenols. It is commonly included in herbal wellness formulations because of its antioxidant properties and potential role in supporting general immune health.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 4\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 5}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">5</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Raspberry</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Raspberry is a nutritious fruit containing naturally occurring antioxidants, vitamins, and plant compounds. It provides polyphenols and other beneficial nutrients that contribute to general nutritional wellness. Its antioxidant content makes it a useful addition to plant-based supplement formulations.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 5\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 6}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">6</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Soursop</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Soursop, also known as Graviola, is a tropical fruit traditionally used in different herbal preparations. It contains naturally occurring plant compounds and antioxidants. It is included in some botanical wellness formulas, although reliable human evidence supporting prostate-specific benefits remains limited.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 6\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 7}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">7</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Calcium — 18 mg</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Calcium, listed as calcium carbonate, is an essential mineral involved in normal cellular signaling and several other physiological functions.<br><br><b>Other Ingredients</b><b><br></b>The published label also lists hypromellose for the vegetable capsule, vegetable stearate, and silicon dioxide as manufacturing/flow aids.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 7\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 8}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">8</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Green Tea and Ginseng</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Green tea and ginseng are significant sources of quercetin. This quercetin helps prevent fungal attacks on the body. It works by entering the fungal plasma tissues to remove the fungal infection. And in this way, it allows you to remove fungal infections of the nails or skin.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 8\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 9}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">9</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Pomegranate</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Pomegranate contains lycopene, which protects cells from damage. It works by protecting the body's cells from fungi. It is also effective in treating gingivitis (gum disease).</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 9\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 10}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">10</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Red Raspberry</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Red raspberry contains two main vitamins, vitamins C and E, which protect against fungal infections. Because of the popularity that KeravitaPro has, This ingredient also boosts immunity and treats germs, viruses, fungi and infections. It also improves the health condition of the skin.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tB6Rwx4pqH",
          "_anchor": "features20-x",
