          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div>Prosta Peak™ is a dietary supplement designed to support men's prostate health and overall urinary wellness. Its botanical ingredient blend includes Saw Palmetto, Pygeum, Green Tea, Cat's Claw, Raspberry, and Soursop. These ingredients contain naturally occurring plant compounds and antioxidants that may contribute to general wellness.</div><div><br></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Prostate Health&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;Prosta Peak™ is formulated to support normal prostate function. Ingredients such as Saw Palmetto and Pygeum have traditionally been used in men's wellness supplements to promote prostate health.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>✅Promotes Urinary Wellness –</b>The botanical ingredients are selected with men's urinary wellness in mind. The formula is intended to complement healthy urinary function as part of a balanced lifestyle.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Provides Antioxidant Support&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;Green Tea, Raspberry, and Soursop contain naturally occurring antioxidants. These compounds help protect cells against oxidative stress and support general cellular health.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Healthy Aging&nbsp;–</b> Maintaining overall wellness becomes increasingly important with age. Prosta Peak™ combines botanical ingredients that may complement a healthy lifestyle and support everyday well-being.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports Men's Overall Wellness – </b>Its combination of plant-based ingredients provides naturally occurring botanical compounds that contribute to general nutritional support for adult men.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Offers Convenient Daily Supplementation –</b>&nbsp;Prosta Peak™ provides a convenient supplement format for men who want to include botanical ingredients in their daily wellness routine.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports General Antioxidant Defense –</b> The plant compounds found in green tea and berries contribute antioxidant activity, helping the body manage everyday oxidative stress.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Complements a Healthy Lifestyle –</b> Prosta Peak™ can be considered alongside healthy habits such as regular exercise, balanced nutrition, sufficient hydration, and appropriate medical care.</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
